    "finalName": "",
    "description": "You may spend a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force_Point\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force Point\">Force Point</a> to attune a melee weapon. Attuning the weapon takes a <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Full-Round_Action\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Full-Round Action\">Full-Round Action</a>. From that point forward, whenever you wield the attuned weapon, you gain a +1 <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force\">Force</a> bonus on attack rolls.<br><br>The weapon is attuned to you alone; others who wield the weapon do not gain the <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Force\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Force\">Force</a> bonus.",
